::  name       rishi history bound gate
::  shape      count - int (@u32) -> lawful - int (@u32)
::  invariant  answers 1 while a kept-line count stays within history=50 (count <= 49 before this one); answers 0 past the wall
::  example    12 -> 1 · 80 -> 0
::  readers    Rishi · Glow Tend a1 · Ashvini
::  nib        equinox-e243-rishi-history-gate-v0
::
::  Ashvini a1 · the recall wall, decided in Glow — STOA331 grammar.
::  rishi/src/main.rye names max_history = 50, the recent input lines kept
::  for :history and :recall. Pedestal-free: the number lives in the elder,
::  and this gate makes it answerable.
|=  sample=@u32
?:  (gth sample 49)  0  1
